### Kysely Codegen

Source: https://context7.com/robinblomberg/kysely-codegen/llms.txt

Kysely Codegen is a command-line tool and library that automatically generates TypeScript type definitions from your database schema for use with the Kysely SQL query builder. It introspects your database, analyzes tables, columns, enums, and data types, then produces fully typed interfaces that enable compile-time type safety for all your database queries.

