### sqlite3Worker1Promiser default worker setup

Source: https://github.com/sqlite/sqlite-wasm/blob/main/src/bin/sqlite3-worker1-promiser.mjs

The defaultConfig shows how sqlite3Worker1Promiser creates its Worker — constructing it from `sqlite3-worker1.mjs` using `new URL` (Vite-compatible) with `type: 'module'`. The Worker internally loads the WASM module which auto-detects and installs the OPFS VFS when COOP/COEP headers are present.

```javascript
globalThis.sqlite3Worker1Promiser.defaultConfig = {
  worker: function(){
