### Allowing Unordered Migrations

Source: https://github.com/kysely-org/kysely/blob/master/site/docs/migrations.mdx

Configures the Migrator to allow migrations to be run even if they are added alphabetically before previously executed ones. This is useful for large teams.

```typescript
import { FileMigrationProvider, Migrator } from 'kysely/migration'

const migrator = new Migrator({
  db,
  provider: new FileMigrationProvider(...),
  allowUnorderedMigrations: true
})
```

### Migrations > Single file vs multiple file migrations

Source: https://github.com/kysely-org/kysely/blob/master/site/docs/migrations.mdx

It is not mandatory to store migrations as separate files. You can implement a custom `MigrationProvider` and provide it to the `Migrator` class when instantiating it.
